sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Traefik
    participant AuthPlugin as Auth Plugin
    participant AuthService as Auth Service
    
    Client->>Traefik: 1. Request with Auth header
    Traefik->>AuthPlugin: 2. Forward request
    
    Note over AuthPlugin: 3. Check Auth header
    Note over AuthPlugin: 4. Test token check
    
    AuthPlugin->>AuthService: 5. Verify token
    AuthService->>AuthPlugin: 6. Return user info
    
    Note over AuthPlugin: 7. Set X-User-Id, X-Request-Id;<br/>delete Authorization

    AuthPlugin->>Traefik: 8. Modified request
    Traefik->>Client: 9. Return response
